# PakWheels

> PakWheels.com is Pakistan's #1 automotive marketplace for buying and selling new and used cars, bikes, and auto parts. The platform offers free classified ad listings, new car and bike prices and specifications, a used-car price calculator, expert and owner reviews, car comparisons, dealer directories, auction sheet verification, professional car inspection, car finance and insurance tools, daily petrol prices, and an active automotive forum and blog. All prices are in PKR and listings cover all major cities of Pakistan.

The site defaults to English (root path /), with an Urdu version under the /ur path. Key user actions: searching used-car and used-bike inventory, posting a free ad to sell a car or bike, researching new car/bike prices and specs, calculating a car's market value, comparing models, verifying an auction sheet, booking a car inspection, and checking today's petrol price. Prices change frequently, so always refer to the linked pages for current figures.

